 * DMA completion callback (runs in ISR context).
 *
 * This implements circular/continuous mode: as soon as a block
 * transfer completes, we reload the DMA to fill the alternate
 * buffer, so the next block starts being collected while the
 * main thread is still processing the one that just finished.
